From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ITSMEFRTRUST <215584995+ITSMEFRTRUST@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:57:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 135/138] media: apple: t7000 ISP: rear camera autofocus
 (ISP_IOC_FOCUS)

New isp-af.c, kept apart from the stream code so it merges cleanly:
- ISP_IOC_FOCUS (uapi minor 1, nr 0x20; INFO's version stays 1):
  continuous / one-shot (tap to focus) / lock / manual / query, an AF
  window (+ optional AE window) in per-mille of the frame, returns the
  fw lens position (CH_FOCUS_POSITION_GET) and the fw status.
- At stream start on the rear IMX237: APPLE_CH_AF_CONTINUOUS_FOCUS_ENABLE
  before CH_START (iOS H6ISPCaptureStreamStart order); af=0 turns all AF
  commands off; af_mode/af_fpix/af_enable/af_start are test knobs.
- focus_ldo: D2186 ldo20 (PMU 0x80 bit 6) powers the rear VCM; iOS turns
  it on right after the sensor AVDD. Set through the PMIC's regmap with
  the sensor rails and restored at power-off (focus_ldo=0 skips it).

Opcodes from the fw 13.42 dispatcher names, layouts from iOS 12
H6ISP.mediacapture (SetAFWindow, EnableContinuousFocus, AutoFocusNow,
SetManualFocusPosition, GetCurrentFocusPosition); per-mille units from
the fw window validator (0x17e80) and scaler (0x7218).

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5

Rebased onto n61-isp-wedge (8 MP presets); keeps isp_af_stream_on before the stream-on log.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
